# The names people see, and only see: the product's, and its code-intelligence service's. Nothing inside the
# code, the deployment or the data is called by them (they are "arena" and "code-intel" there), so a build
# with other names changes what people read and nothing else.
#
# Read by every build: .NET (Directory.Build.props, into Brand.Product and Brand.CodeIntel) and the web
# (src/web/vite.config.ts). PRODUCT_NAME and CODE_INTEL_NAME in the build's environment (or as docker build
# arguments: deploy/.env) win over these. The product's name can still be changed at run time too (Settings
# → Branding), as an admin's own.
PRODUCT_NAME=Farzan Arena
CODE_INTEL_NAME=Farzan Graph
